{"title":"Test ID - 39 [Compiler Test 1 - ] 2026","fileName":"Test_ID_-_39_Compiler_Test_1_-_2026.html","branch":"COMPUTER SCIENCE ENGINEERING","series":"GATE-2026","provider":"GATE ZEAL","duration":3600,"questions":[{"qnum":1,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/fc42b83a-9eea-45fc-8612-c53b916ffd64.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/9cf938a1-cab6-4eca-8f2f-aab1f477c0d5.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Test ID - 39 [Compiler Test 1 - ] 2026"},{"qnum":2,"type":"MCQ","correct":"A","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/f769b337-6215-4918-b139-e6ea0302c900.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/e5dd60c1-6e44-4961-a2b4-d78794993157.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/ebbe8ab3-d531-4090-a372-c46eb38890b9.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>","subject":"Test ID - 39 [Compiler Test 1 - ] 2026"},{"qnum":3,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A,C","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/5714caab-086c-4b3b-b80c-115285dd2bdb.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p><span>Which of the following statements is/are TRUE?<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>(a) Under static scoping, the output for init(1) is 7 -3.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>(b) Under static scoping, the output for init (1) is 9 -5.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>(c) Under dynamic scoping, the output for init (1) is 5 -2.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span>(d) Under dynamic scoping, the output for init (1) is 7 -5.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p></p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<p>a</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"B","text":"<p>b</p>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<p>c</p>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<p>d</p>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p><span>Answer: (a, c)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>Solution:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<span>Static scoping trace (init (1))<o:p></o:p></span>\n<p><span>init: set </span><code><span>a=1, b=-1</span></code><span>, then </span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>a=3,\nb=-2</span></code><span>.<br /></span><code><span>a&gt;=b</span></code><span> true &rarr; call </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>In </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>: local </span><code><span>b\n= a+1 = 4</span></code><span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>Call </span><code><span>G</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>In </span><code><span>G</span></code><span>: local </span><code><span>a\n= b-1 = -3</span></code><span> (uses global </span><code><span>b=-2</span></code><span>).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>Call </span><code><span>F</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&sect;<span> </span></span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; global </span><code><span>a=5,\nb=-3</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>&sect;<span> </span></span><code><span>a&lt;b</span></code><span>? </span><code><span>5&lt;-3</span></code><span> no &rarr; </span><code><span>b+=3</span></code><span> &rarr; global </span><code><span>b=0</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><code><span>a+=4</span></code><span> (local </span><code><span>a</span></code><span> becomes 1; globals unchanged)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><code><span>b-=2</span></code><span> &rarr; global </span><code><span>b=-2</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>Back to </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>: call </span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; global </span><code><span>a=7,\nb=-3</span></code><span><br />Prints: <strong>7 -3</strong><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<span>Dynamic scoping trace (init (1))<o:p></o:p></span>\n<p><span>init: </span><code><span>a=1, b=-1</span></code><span>, then </span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>a=3,\nb=-2</span></code><span>.<br /></span><code><span>a&gt;=b</span></code><span> true &rarr; call </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>In </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>: local </span><code><span>b\n= a+1 = 4</span></code><span> (a is global here).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>Call </span><code><span>G</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>In </span><code><span>G</span></code><span>: local </span><code><span>a\n= b-1 = 3</span></code><span> (uses </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>&rsquo;s local </span><code><span>b=4</span></code><span>).<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>Call </span><code><span>F</span></code><span>:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>&sect;<span> </span></span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; acts on </span><code><span>G.a</span></code><span> and </span><code><span>H.b</span></code><span>: </span><code><span>G.a=5</span></code><span>, </span><code><span>H.b=3</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>&sect;<span> </span></span><code><span>a&lt;b</span></code><span>? </span><code><span>5&lt;3</span></code><span> no &rarr; </span><code><span>b+=3</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>H.b=6</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>Back to </span><code><span>G</span></code><span>: </span><code><span>a+=4</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>G.a=9</span></code><span>; </span><code><span>b-=2</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>H.b=4</span></code><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p><span>&middot;<span> </span></span><span>Back to </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>: call </span><code><span>T()</span></code><span> &rarr; </span><code><span>a</span></code><span> is global (no local), </span><code><span>b</span></code><span> is </span><code><span>H</span></code><span>&rsquo;s local:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span>o<span> </span></span><span>global </span><code><span>a=5</span></code><span>, </span><code><span>H.b=3</span></code><span><br />Prints: <strong>5 -2</strong> (global </span><code><span>b</span></code><span> stayed at -2)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<span>Correct options<o:p></o:p></span>\n<p><span>(a) <strong>True</strong> &mdash; static scoping with </span><code><span>init (1)</span></code><span> prints </span><code><span>7\n-3</span></code><span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>(b) <strong>False</strong> &mdash; that&rsquo;s not the static result for </span><code><span>init (1)</span></code><span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p><span>(c) <strong>True</strong> &mdash; dynamic scoping with </span><code><span>init (1)</span></code><span> prints </span><code><span>5\n-2</span></code><span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span>(d) <strong>False</strong> &mdash; dynamic does not print </span><code><span>7 -5</span></code><span> for </span><code><span>init\n(1)</span></code><span>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>","subject":"Test ID - 39 [Compiler Test 1 - ] 2026"},{"qnum":4,"type":"MSQ","correct":"A","right":2,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p><img src=\"https://cms-cdn.classplus.co/parserImages/67104c34-9